<div id="header">
<h1>CodeRay</h1>
</div>
<div id="content">
<div id="preamble">
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p><a href="http://coderay.rubychan.de/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CodeRay</a> is an encoding-aware, syntax highlighter that supports the languages listed below.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none fit-content">
<colgroup>
<col>
<col>
